# One line ending everywhere: GitHub, Linux/cPanel, and Windows checkouts (even with
# core.autocrlf=true). Tests read sources as text and migrations are checksummed, so a CRLF
# working copy used to fail tests and look like an edited migration.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.ico binary
*.gif binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.zip binary
*.mp3 binary
*.mp4 binary
*.webm binary
*.wav binary
*.ogg binary
*.m4a binary
